  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\"The palace door closed behind them, and the difficult truth was revealed.
    Though brought to Malacca through Hang Tuah\u2019s deception, Tun Teja accepted
    her fate with the grace befitting her lineage. She wed Sultan Mahmud Shah, becoming
    a beloved and revered Queen who brought great dignity to the court. Yet, legends
    whisper that behind her regal composure lingered a quiet sorrow\u2014an eternal
    testament to the heavy price of unyielding loyalty and a heart sacrificed for
    the glory of the Sultanate.\"\n\n                                                    
    Press T to skip"
